            "text": "<ul><li>Regularly lint roll your linen or boucle fabric bed to lift everyday dirt or hair.</li><li>Occasionally, the cover may need a slight adjustment after use to fit perfectly over the mattress. Simply use your hands to gently smooth and tuck the cover into place.</li><li>Treat accidents, dirt or spills as soon as possible. Use a warm damp cloth to gently dab and lift spills.</li><li>Use only water and mild detergent  to spot clean. </li></ul>"
