            "text": "<ul><li>Our fabric bed covers are machine washable. However, they must be washed with water no hotter than 30 degrees, on a gentle cycle. </li><li>Do not bleach. Do not use strong detergent. </li><li>We do not recommend tumble drying. </li><li>Air dry only</li></ul>"
