            "text": "<p>Please handle fabric bed covers with care. <br/><br/>To remove, unzip the base and pull the mattress out. <br/>to remove the bolster pillow, unzip the internal zipper all the way around, and pull the pillow out. </p><p>To put the cover on, do the reverse. Gently put the bolster pillow in, and zip that up. Then add the mattress in and carefully zip around the base. </p>"
